  "description": "This task scheduler allows you to manage tasks. There is a main scheduler, \n\t\twhich is limited by the number of processor cores. Inside it, an internal scheduler can be used, \n\t\twhich is limited to three times the number of processor cores. Additionally, \n\t\tthere is a scheduler for simple I/O-bound operations.",
